OL,3,GNEWSAWindsurfing world championships
OL,4,Abegin at Olympic venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 250 of the world's leading
OL,7,Fwindsurfers, representing more than 40
OL,8,Fnations, are competing for the iQFOiL
OL,9,FWorld Championships.
OL,11,FThe six-day competition, which starts
OL,12,Fon Monday, is being hosted by the Royal
OL,13,FYachting Association (RYA) at the
OL,14,FWeymouth and Portland National Sailing
OL,15,FAcademy in Dorset.
OL,17,FA fan zone next to Weymouth Pavilion,
OL,18,Fwith a big screen, commentary, athlete
OL,19,Finterviews, music and medal ceremonies,
OL,20,Fwill open on Saturday from 10:00 BST to
OL,21,F18:00, with racing from 12:00.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
