OL,3,GNEWSAWindsurfing world championships
OL,4,Abegin at Olympic venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe zone will run alongside Weymouth
OL,7,FWater Fest on the beach, where there
OL,8,Fwill be opportunities to try free,
OL,9,Fbookable activities including kayaking,
OL,10,Fpaddleboarding, beach yoga and sea
OL,11,Fswimming.
